{"n":97,"verses":[{"k":1,"w":[["إِنَّآ","innaa"],["أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","anzalnaahu"],["فِى","fee"],["لَيْلَةِ","laylati"],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","l-qadr"]],"en":"Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree.","t":{"6":[[700,2120],[2130,6590],[6600,7490],[7500,8980],[8990,10250]],"12":[[200,2730],[2740,5340],[5350,6050],[6060,7230],[7240,8370]],"7":[[150,2890],[2900,5410],[5420,5880],[5890,6710],[6720,7260]],"9":[[400,1630],[1640,6180],[6190,6830],[6840,8010],[8020,8990]]}},{"k":2,"w":[["وَمَآ","wamaa"],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","adraaka"],["مَا","maa"],["لَيْلَةُ","laylatu"],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","l-qadr"]],"en":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","t":{"6":[[450,2470],[2480,4260],[4270,5040],[5050,6500],[6510,7590]],"12":[[200,1980],[1990,3530],[3540,4170],[4180,5370],[5380,6390]],"7":[[40,390],[400,3200],[3210,3630],[3640,4430],[4440,4990]],"9":[[400,750],[760,3990],[4000,4620],[4630,5800],[5810,6730]]}},{"k":3,"w":[["لَيْلَةُ","laylatu"],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","l-qadri"],["خَيْرٌۭ","khayrun"],["مِّنْ","min"],["أَلْفِ","alfi"],["شَهْرٍۢ","shahrin"]],"en":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","t":{"6":[[350,1590],[1600,2880],[2890,4940],[4950,5560],[5570,6710],[6720,7660]],"12":[[300,1370],[1380,2460],[2470,4230],[4240,4820],[4830,5740],[5750,6550]],"7":[[150,870],[880,1640],[1650,3350],[3360,3680],[3690,4250],[4260,4770]],"9":[[400,1550],[1560,2590],[2600,4440],[4450,4910],[4920,5700],[5710,6400]]}},{"k":4,"w":[["تَنَزَّلُ","tanazzalu"],["ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","l-malaaikatu"],["وَٱلرُّوحُ","wal-roohu"],["فِيهَا","feehaa"],["بِإِذْنِ","bi-idh'ni"],["رَبِّهِم","rabbihim"],["مِّن","min"],["كُلِّ","kulli"],["أَمْرٍۢ","amrin"]],"en":"The angels and the Spirit descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","t":{"6":[[500,2040],[2050,5510],[5520,7290],[7300,9010],[9020,10290],[10300,12710],[12720,13700],[13710,14870],[14880,15550]],"12":[[500,1750],[1760,4800],[4810,6280],[6290,7850],[13290,14410],[14420,15650],[15660,17430],[17440,18450],[18460,19120]],"7":[[30,1010],[1020,3980],[3990,4940],[4950,5800],[5810,6550],[6560,8310],[8320,9380],[9390,10050],[10060,10570]],"9":[[350,1740],[1750,4690],[4700,6010],[6020,7260],[7270,8350],[8360,10510],[10520,11440],[11450,12430],[12440,12980]]}},{"k":5,"w":[["سَلَـٰمٌ","salaamun"],["هِىَ","hiya"],["حَتَّىٰ","hattaa"],["مَطْلَعِ","matla'i"],["ٱلْفَجْرِ","l-fajr"]],"en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","t":{"6":[[300,1800],[1810,2530],[2540,4070],[4080,5660],[5670,6700]],"12":[[500,1820],[1830,2400],[2410,3840],[3850,5030],[5040,6050]],"7":[[200,1080],[1090,1530],[1540,2420],[2430,3380],[3390,4050]],"9":[[400,1820],[1830,2360],[2370,3630],[3640,4860],[4870,5760]]}}]}